      "id": "claim_efccc1249fc94120905091a5efb8257c",
      "statement": "GPI-C sends CBPR+ ISO 20022 pacs.008 customer credit transfers, mandatory since Swift's 2025-11-22 end of MT/MX coexistence; CNB does not use the MT103 contingency conversion path, and PPH assigns the UETR (UUID v4) at release which GPI-C carries and maps Swift ACK/NAK back to PPH.",
